message: "If you use Navital Gym, please cite it as below."
title: "Navital Gym: deterministic, auto-graded environments for AI agents doing Indian-reality tasks"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Navital Labs"
version: "1.0.0"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Navitallabs/navital-gym"
url: "https://huggingface.co/NavitalLabs"
keywords: [agents, evaluation, benchmark, reinforcement-learning, India, tool-use]
abstract: "A suite of sandboxed, deterministic environments with exact graders (no LLM judge) for agents doing tasks set in India: trip planning with rail quotas, GST invoicing, form filling, regional-language customer support and more. Code is Apache-2.0, task data CC BY 4.0."
